##Minecar Page
bw_vv.guide_book.vehicle_page.minecar.title=Vehicles - Minecar
bw_vv.guide_book.vehicle_page.minecar.description=The Minecar is the simplest and cutest vehicle of all! It has no special abilities, yet you can customise it with lots of stickers!
bw_vv.guide_book.vehicle_page.minecar.crafting=Open a §eCrafting Table§f and combine §e1xMinecart§f, §e2xIron Ingots§f, §e1xFurnace§f, §e1xTorch§f, §e1xGlass Pane§f, and any §e1xPlanks§f block.

##Mobtruck Page
bw_vv.guide_book.vehicle_page.mobtruck.title=Vehicles - Mobtruck
bw_vv.guide_book.vehicle_page.mobtruck.description=The Mobtruck is any farmer's dream! With a rustic-mechanical design, this vehicle can carry mobs around in its trunk!
bw_vv.guide_book.vehicle_page.mobtruck.features=Interact with the §eTrunk §fat the back of the Mobtruck to open it. Nearby mobs will automatically join in! Interact with it §eagain§f to §eclose§f.
bw_vv.guide_book.vehicle_page.mobtruck.crafting=Open a §eCrafting Table§f and combine §e1xFence Gate§f, §e1xFence§f, §e1xGlass Pane§f, §e2xMinecarts§f, §e1xTorch§f, §e1xRedstone Pulser§f, and §e2xIron Ingots§f.

##Logcar Page
bw_vv.guide_book.vehicle_page.logcar.title=Vehicles - Logcar
bw_vv.guide_book.vehicle_page.logcar.description=The Logcar came from deep within the forest, and is here to help you carry your friends' backs! (literally).
bw_vv.guide_book.vehicle_page.logcar.features=The Logcar can carry §e2 players§f at the same time!
bw_vv.guide_book.vehicle_page.logcar.crafting=Open a §eCrafting Table§f and combine §e1xFurnace§f, §e1xTorch§f, §e2xIron Ingots§f, and §e3xPlanks§f.

##Plane Page
bw_vv.guide_book.vehicle_page.plane.title=Vehicles - Plane
bw_vv.guide_book.vehicle_page.plane.description=The Plane is the cheapest alternative to the Elytra! Perfect for exploring large biomes and traveling long distances.
bw_vv.guide_book.vehicle_page.plane.features=You can fly in any direction you look! Drive the Plane on a flat surface & §elook up§f to take off! To land, simply §elook down§f, and try to stick the landing.
bw_vv.guide_book.vehicle_page.plane.features2=Careful! Crashing into blocks at high speeds will make the Plane §eexplode§f!.
bw_vv.guide_book.vehicle_page.plane.features3=Perform a §eroll§f in the direction you are steering! (§eLeft/Right§f). While riding, hit the Plane.
bw_vv.guide_book.vehicle_page.plane.crafting=Open a §eCrafting Table§f and combine §e2xWool§f, §e2xLogs§f, §e1xPropeller§f, and §e1xRedstone Pulser§f.

##Hot Air Balloon Page
bw_vv.guide_book.vehicle_page.hot_air_balloon.title=Vehicles - Hot Air Balloon
bw_vv.guide_book.vehicle_page.hot_air_balloon.description=The Hot Air Balloon is the most relaxing way to explore your world from above!
bw_vv.guide_book.vehicle_page.hot_air_balloon.features=Interact with the §eHot Air Balloon Basket§f with a §eHot Air Balloon Envelope§f. Then, interact again with §eFlint and Steel§f to ignite and take off!
bw_vv.guide_book.vehicle_page.hot_air_balloon.features2=Press §e:_input_key.jump:§f to rise higher, release to descend.
bw_vv.guide_book.vehicle_page.hot_air_balloon.features3=Use §eShears§f to remove the §eHot Air Balloon Envelope§f.
bw_vv.guide_book.vehicle_page.hot_air_balloon.crafting=Open a §eCrafting Table§f and combine §e2xLeads§f, §e2xIron Ingots§f, and §e5xBamboo§f.

##Steamboat Page
bw_vv.guide_book.vehicle_page.steamboat.title=Vehicles - Steamboat
bw_vv.guide_book.vehicle_page.steamboat.description=The Steamboat is perfect for a relaxing cruise along the river!
bw_vv.guide_book.vehicle_page.steamboat.features=Drive the Steamboat like a regular boat!
bw_vv.guide_book.vehicle_page.steamboat.features2=The Steamboat can carry §e3 players§f at the same time!
bw_vv.guide_book.vehicle_page.steamboat.features3=Interact with the Steamboat while holding a §eBell§f to attach it. Then, hit the Bell to ring it!
bw_vv.guide_book.vehicle_page.steamboat.crafting=Open a §eCrafting Table§f and combine §e1xFurnace§f, §e1xIron Block§f, §e1xWool§f, and §e4xPlanks§f.

##Prismer Page
bw_vv.guide_book.vehicle_page.prismer.title=Vehicles - Prismer
bw_vv.guide_book.vehicle_page.prismer.description=The Prismer is a mysterious vehicle that was found deep underwater, near Temples.
bw_vv.guide_book.vehicle_page.prismer.features=This hybrid between creature and machine will give you the ability to mine more quickly, see better & breathe underwater while riding it!
bw_vv.guide_book.vehicle_page.prismer.crafting=It's the only vehicle in the Add-On that §ecan't§f be crafted! You can only find spawning naturally in oceans.

##Mech Page
bw_vv.guide_book.vehicle_page.mech.title=Vehicles - Mech
bw_vv.guide_book.vehicle_page.mech.description=The Mech is a powerful, end-game machine that can destroy everything in its path!
bw_vv.guide_book.vehicle_page.mech.features=You can §ePower Jump§f, similar to a §eHorse§f.
bw_vv.guide_book.vehicle_page.mech.features2=While riding, hit to fire a §eRedstone Projectile§f that can destroy blocks and damage mobs! Has a §e3 second cooldown§f.
bw_vv.guide_book.vehicle_page.mech.features3=Boost while §emid-air§f by pressing §e:_input_key.jump:§f(and wearing a §eTesla Helmet§f) to glide forward!

bw_vv.guide_book.vehicle_page.mech.crafting=Open a §eCrafting Table§f and combine §e1xMechanical Heart§f, §e2xPistons§f, §e1xChest§f, §e2xLogs§f, §e1xIron Block§f, and §e3xPlanks§f.

