##Redstone Compressor Page
bw_vv.guide_book.utility_page.redstone_compressor.title=Utilities - Redstone Compressor
bw_vv.guide_book.utility_page.redstone_compressor.description=The Redstone Compressor is the newest adition to your redstone repertoire!
bw_vv.guide_book.utility_page.redstone_compressor.crafting=Open a §eCrafting Table§f and combine §e1xPiston§f & §e1xComparator§f.
bw_vv.guide_book.utility_page.redstone_compressor.features=Interact with the Compressor while holding §eRedstone Dust§f, and it will be transformed into §eCompressed Redstone§f 50%% of the time (Each Redstone item produces betwen 0 and 1xCompressed Redstone). You can also §edrop Redstone Dust§f next to it, and they will automatically be picked up.

##Wind Vane Page
bw_vv.guide_book.utility_page.wind_vane.title=Utilities - Wind Vane
bw_vv.guide_book.utility_page.wind_vane.description=The Wind Vane is a simple block that shows you the current wind direction!
bw_vv.guide_book.utility_page.wind_vane.features=Place the Wind Vane down, and it will rotate to point in the direction of the wind, which affects the flight of the §eHot Air Balloon§f.
bw_vv.guide_book.utility_page.wind_vane.features2=A §eRedstone Signal§f is emitted based on the wind direction.
bw_vv.guide_book.utility_page.wind_vane.crafting=Open a §eCrafting Table§f and combine §e3xIron Ingots§f, §e1xFence§f, §e1xRedstone Torch§f & §e3xIron Nugget§f.

##Smoke Bombs Page
bw_vv.guide_book.utility_page.smoke_bombs.title=Utilities - Smoke Bombs
bw_vv.guide_book.utility_page.smoke_bombs.description=Smoke Bombs are fun items that create colorful smoke effects when used!
bw_vv.guide_book.utility_page.smoke_bombs.features=You can §eplace down§f a Smoke Bomb and it will create colorful smoke effects for §e8 seconds§f.
bw_vv.guide_book.utility_page.smoke_bombs.features2=§eInteract§f with compatible §evehicles§f while holding a Smoke Bomb to leave a colorful smoke trail behind!
bw_vv.guide_book.utility_page.smoke_bombs.crafting=Open a §eCrafting Table§f or §eInventory Crafting§f and combine §e1xPiston§f & §e1xRedstone Pulser§f.

##Tesla Helmet Page
bw_vv.guide_book.utility_page.tesla_helmet.title=Utilities - Tesla Helmet
bw_vv.guide_book.utility_page.tesla_helmet.description=The Tesla Helmet is a high-tech piece of equipment that enhances your vehicle experience! Might have Mr. Tesla himself had something to do with it...?
bw_vv.guide_book.utility_page.tesla_helmet.features=Wear the Tesla Helmet to enable §eVehicle Boosting§f! While riding a compatible vehicle, press §e:_input_key.jump:§f to temporarily boost your speed.
bw_vv.guide_book.utility_page.tesla_helmet.crafting=Open a §eSmithing Table§f and use a §eTesla Helmet Upgrade§f item, with a §eNetherite Helmet§f, and a §eNetherite Ingot§f.

