bw_vv.guide_book.systems_page.title=Systems
bw_vv.guide_book.systems_page.description=These systems will help you advance your vehicles further.

##Vehicle Boosting Page
bw_vv.guide_book.system_page.boosting.title=Systems - Vehicle Boosting
bw_vv.guide_book.system_page.boosting.description=To use §eVehicle Boosting§f, you need to be wearing a §eTesla Helmet§f. While riding a compatible vehicle, press §e:_input_key.jump:§f to boost your speed for 5 seconds.
bw_vv.guide_book.system_page.boosting.features=Be careful not to overuse it, as it consumes fuel §efaster§f!
bw_vv.guide_book.system_page.boosting.features2=Wait a §ecooldown period§f of 7 seconds before boosting again.
##Vehicle Customisation Page
bw_vv.guide_book.system_page.customisation.title=Systems - Vehicle Customisation
bw_vv.guide_book.system_page.customisation.description=You can customise some vehicles with §eStickers§f and §eDyes§f!
bw_vv.guide_book.system_page.customisation.features.1=Apply §eStickers§f by interacting with your vehicle. Breaking the vehicle will also drop the sticker. You remove an applied Sticker using §eShears§f.
bw_vv.guide_book.system_page.customisation.features.2=Some vehicles also support using §eDyes§f to change their color partially or completely! When broken in surivival mode, dyed vehicles will drop back the used dye.
bw_vv.guide_book.system_page.customisation.features.3=Add a §eChest§f or a §eBundle§f to your vehicle by interacting while holding the item. This will allow you to carry extra items! Only undyed bundles can be used.
bw_vv.guide_book.system_page.customisation.features.4=Interact with the vehicle while holding a §eSmoke Bomb§f to leave a colorful smoke trail behind as you ride!
##Wind System Page
bw_vv.guide_book.system_page.wind.title=Systems - Wind System
bw_vv.guide_book.system_page.wind.description=You world now has §ewind§f! The direction changes every §e3 in-game days§f to one of the 4 cardinal directions, §eN§f, §eS§f, §eW§f & §eE§f.
bw_vv.guide_book.system_page.wind.features=Use a §eWind Vane§f to check the current wind direction. It will point in the direction of the wind.
bw_vv.guide_book.system_page.wind.features2=The §eHot Air Balloon§f is affected by the wind, so plan your routes accordingly!


##Other Items Page
bw_vv.guide_book.other_items_page.title=Other Items
bw_vv.guide_book.other_items_page.description=These items will help you with crafting some vehicles. Learn how to obtain them here:

bw_vv.guide_book.item_page.propeller.title=Propeller
bw_vv.guide_book.item_page.propeller.description=A lightweight metal component used to craft various vehicles.

bw_vv.guide_book.item_page.redstone_pulser.title=Redstone Pulser
bw_vv.guide_book.item_page.redstone_pulser.description=A compact redstone device that sends a steady pulse, used in advanced machinery.

bw_vv.guide_book.item_page.hot_air_balloon.envelope.blank.title=Blank Balloon Envelope
bw_vv.guide_book.item_page.hot_air_balloon.envelope.blank.description=A simple balloon envelope made of stitched leather, used as a base for custom designs.

bw_vv.guide_book.item_page.hot_air_balloon.envelope.creeper.title=Creeper Balloon Envelope
bw_vv.guide_book.item_page.hot_air_balloon.envelope.creeper.description=A Creeper-patterned balloon envelope crafted from a Blank Envelope and a Creeper Sticker.

bw_vv.guide_book.item_page.hot_air_balloon.envelope.striped.title=Striped Balloon Envelope
bw_vv.guide_book.item_page.hot_air_balloon.envelope.striped.description=A striped balloon envelope crafted from a Blank Envelope and a Stripes Sticker.

bw_vv.guide_book.item_page.mechanical_heart.title=Mechanical Heart
bw_vv.guide_book.item_page.mechanical_heart.description=A powerful mechanical core used to animate and power advanced vehicles.

bw_vv.guide_book.item_page.blueprints.title=Blueprints
bw_vv.guide_book.item_page.blueprints.description=Essential schematics needed to craft high-tech items and vehicle components.

bw_vv.guide_book.item_page.smoke_bomb.title=Smoke Bombs
bw_vv.guide_book.item_page.smoke_bomb.description=Smoke Bombs create colorful smoke effects when used, perfect for signaling or creating visual effects.

bw_vv.guide_book.item_page.stickers.title=Stickers
bw_vv.guide_book.item_page.stickers.description=Decorative stickers that can be applied to vehicles for customization. Available in various designs!

bw_vv.guide_book.item_page.flags.title=Decorative Flags
bw_vv.guide_book.item_page.flags.description=Can be placed on the ground, rotates in the direction of the wind! Available in all 16 colors.
bw_vv.guide_book.item_page.flags.crafting=To craft a §eFlag Pole§f, open a §eCrafting Table§f and combine §e3xSticks§f in a vertical line. Then, Craft any flag using a §eFlag Pole§f and §e1xWool Block§f, of any color.
bw_vv.guide_book.button.flags=Decorative Flags

bw_vv.guide_book.item_page.compressed_redstone.title=Compressed Redstone
bw_vv.guide_book.item_page.compressed_redstone.description=Compressed Redstone is a crystal form of §eRedstone Dust§f, used as fuel for certain vehicles. More concentration, more power!

bw_vv.guide_book.item_page.hot_air_balloon.envelope.title=Hot Air Balloon Envelope
bw_vv.guide_book.item_page.hot_air_balloon.envelope.description=Different designs of balloon envelopes for your §eHot Air Balloon§f. Customize it to your liking!

bw_vv.guide_book.item_page.tesla_helmet_upgrade.title=Tesla Helmet Upgrade
bw_vv.guide_book.item_page.tesla_helmet_upgrade.description=A special upgrade item used to enhance a §eNetherite Helmet§f into a §eTesla Helmet§f, enabling vehicle boosting capabilities.
bw_vv.guide_book.item_page.tesla_helmet_upgrade.crafting=Can only be obtained from the §eMechanic. §fOpen a §eSmithing Table§f and use a §eTesla Helmet Upgrade§f item, with a §eNetherite Helmet§f, and a §eNetherite Ingot§f to obtain the §eTesla Helmet§f.

##Mobs page
bw_vv.guide_book.mobs_page.title=Mobs
bw_vv.guide_book.mobs_page.description=New mobs added by the Add-On!
bw_vv.guide_book.button.mechanic=Mechanic Villager

bw_vv.guide_book.mob_page.mechanic.title=Mobs - Mechanic Villager
bw_vv.guide_book.mob_page.mechanic.description=The Mechanic is a friendly villager that specializes in vehicle-related trades. Don't underestimate their knowledge!
bw_vv.guide_book.mob_page.mechanic.trading=You can trade with the Mechanic to obtain §eBlueprints§f, §eStickers§f, §eSmoke Bombs§f, and other items, and most importantly the §eTesla Helmet Upgrade§f item.


bw_vv.guide_book.item_page.propeller.crafting=Open a §eCrafting Table§f and combine §e2xIron Ingots§f and §e1xIron Nugget§f.
bw_vv.guide_book.item_page.redstone_pulser.crafting=Open a §eCrafting Table§f and combine §e1xCompressed Redstone§f and §e1xComparator§f.
bw_vv.guide_book.item_page.hot_air_balloon.envelope.blank.crafting=§lBlank Envelope§r: Open a §eCrafting Table§f and combine §e9xLeather§f.
bw_vv.guide_book.item_page.hot_air_balloon.envelope.creeper.crafting=§lCreeper Envelope§r: Open a §eCrafting Table§f and combine §e1xBlank Envelope§f and §e1xCreeper Sticker§f.
bw_vv.guide_book.item_page.hot_air_balloon.envelope.striped.crafting=§lStriped Envelope§r: Open a §eCrafting Table§f and combine §e1xBlank Envelope§f and §e1xStripes Sticker§f.
bw_vv.guide_book.item_page.mechanical_heart.crafting=Open a §eCrafting Table§f and combine §e1xBlaze Powder§f, §e2xNetherite Ingot§f, §e1xBlueprints§f & §e1xRedstone Pulser§f.
bw_vv.guide_book.item_page.smoke_bomb.crafting=To create an §eEmpty Smoke Bomb§f, open a §eCrafting Table§f and combine §e1xPiston§f and §e1xRedstone Pulser§f.
bw_vv.guide_book.item_page.smoke_bomb.crafting2=To dye, combine §e1xEmpty Smoke Bomb§f and §e1xDye§f. After use, you recieve your Empty Smoke Bomb back.
bw_vv.guide_book.item_page.blueprints.crafting=Can only be obtained from a §eMechanic§f villager.
bw_vv.guide_book.item_page.stickers.crafting=Can only be obtained from a §eMechanic§f villager.
bw_vv.guide_book.item_page.stickers.crafting2=Stickers you can get: §eBloom§f, §eCastle§f, §eCreeper§f, §eDiamonds§f, §eEnder§f, §eHearts§f, §eIcy§f, §eRainbow§f, §eSkeleton§f, §eStripes§f.
bw_vv.guide_book.item_page.compressed_redstone.crafting=Obtained by using a §eRedstone Compressor§f to compress §eRedstone Dust§f. §eCompressed Redstone§f has a 50%% chance to drop. Interact while holding Redstone, and open the Compressor's inventory to get the result.

